linuxmuster-fileserver-verwaltung (7.3.1) lmn73; urgency=medium

  * Apply the faircomp package conventions (linuxmusterDEV
    docs/paket-konventionen.md); no functional changes.
  * Build with "make deb" as the uniform entry point (dpkg-buildpackage
    -us -uc -tc); CI builds in the lmndev-runner container that also builds
    the official linuxmuster.net packages, chosen by the changelog
    distribution.
  * Add ci.yml: on every push and pull request compile and lint the CLI,
    build the package in the container and run the install smoke test on
    Ubuntu 24.04 (previously only on tags).
  * Align release.yml with the shared template: the tag must equal the
    changelog version, build in the container, install smoke, GitHub
    release with .deb and .changes, prerelease for -rc tags.
  * Add CLAUDE.md with the working rules of this repository.
  * Commit messages are English conventional commits (type(scope): subject)
    from this version on; the history stays as it is.
  * Settle the licensing note: configuration examples and debian/rules rewritten as
    original work, LICENSE (GPL-3.0-or-later) added, debian/copyright without the
    UNRESOLVED stanza; the repository is public, docs no longer call it private.

